<text x="-55.88" y="25.4" size="1.778" layer="91">spi2 - Mcp4922 SCK
PB15 -Mcp4922 SDI
PB9 - Mcp4922 CS
PA6 - Switch Aref
PA3 - Switch Aref
PB1 - CV in2
PB0 - CV in2
PB6 - Trig out 1
PA12 - Trig out 2
PA8 - D6
PB8 - D7
PC15 - Button3
PC13 - Button2
PC13 &amp; 15 - Button&lt;&lt;
PC14 - Button1
PA15 - Button4
PC14 &amp; PA15 - Button &gt;&gt;
PB4 - Button &lt;&lt;1
PA2 - Pot1 
PA0 -Pot2 
PA1 - Pot3 
PA4 - Pot4
PA11 - SD CS
PB15 - SD MOSI
PB13 - SD SCK
PB14 - MISO
PA9 - OLED D0
PA10 - OLED D1
PB11 - OLED RES
PB10 - OLED DC
PB5 - OLED CS
PB12 - Trig in
PB7 - Trig in

</text>
</plain>
